{"video_id":"vljxQZfJ9wY","title":"Production Evals For Agentic AI Systems - Nishant Gupta, Meta Superintelligence Labs","conference":"ai-engineer","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":1143,"segments":[{"start":3.32,"duration":4.88,"text":"Hey everyone. My name is Nishant Gupta"},{"start":6.28,"duration":3.04,"text":"and I'm a software engineering tech lead"},{"start":8.2,"duration":2.44,"text":"at Meta"},{"start":9.32,"duration":3.84,"text":"working on building the training and"},{"start":10.64,"duration":4.52,"text":"inference infrastructure"},{"start":13.16,"duration":4.2,"text":"for the Meta Super Dangerous Lab and the"},{"start":15.16,"duration":3.6,"text":"infrastructure organization."},{"start":17.36,"duration":4.56,"text":"Today we're going to be talking about"},{"start":18.76,"duration":4.52,"text":"production of ads for agentic systems."},{"start":21.92,"duration":3.52,"text":"When most people hear the word"},{"start":23.28,"duration":5.04,"text":"evaluation, they think about benchmarks."},{"start":25.44,"duration":6.36,"text":"A model scores 90% on a benchmark. A new"},{"start":28.32,"duration":5.12,"text":"version scores 92%. The team celebrates."},{"start":31.8,"duration":3.96,"text":"But agentic systems have fundamentally"},{"start":33.44,"duration":4.6,"text":"changed what the evaluation means."},{"start":35.76,"duration":4.72,"text":"Today the systems don't simply generate"},{"start":38.04,"duration":4.0,"text":"answers. They plan. They call tools."},{"start":40.48,"duration":3.16,"text":"They retrieve information. They execute"},{"start":42.04,"duration":3.68,"text":"workflows. They interact with the"},{"start":43.64,"duration":3.84,"text":"production infrastructure."},{"start":45.72,"duration":3.44,"text":"The question is no longer did the model"},{"start":47.48,"duration":3.08,"text":"generate the right answer?"},{"start":49.16,"duration":2.56,"text":"The question is did the system behave"},{"start":50.56,"duration":3.8,"text":"correctly?"},{"start":51.72,"duration":4.4,"text":"Today I would like to discuss how"},{"start":54.36,"duration":3.32,"text":"evaluation is evolving from model"},{"start":56.12,"duration":4.28,"text":"benchmarking into production"},{"start":57.68,"duration":2.72,"text":"infrastructure."},{"start":62.36,"duration":4.0,"text":"This is the problem almost every AI"},{"start":64.28,"duration":4.72,"text":"organization is encountering today."},{"start":66.36,"duration":4.32,"text":"Offline benchmarks continue improving."},{"start":69.0,"duration":3.0,"text":"Yet production reliability often remains"},{"start":70.68,"duration":2.52,"text":"unpredictable."},{"start":72.0,"duration":2.72,"text":"Why is that?"},{"start":73.2,"duration":3.64,"text":"Because benchmarks measure model"},{"start":74.72,"duration":4.32,"text":"capability. Production measures system"},{"start":76.84,"duration":5.12,"text":"behavior. A benchmark doesn't capture"},{"start":79.04,"duration":4.96,"text":"tool failure, API outage, context"},{"start":81.96,"duration":3.44,"text":"changes, user variability, long running"},{"start":84.0,"duration":3.04,"text":"workflows."},{"start":85.4,"duration":2.88,"text":"And as systems become more autonomous,"},{"start":87.04,"duration":2.68,"text":"the gap between the benchmark"},{"start":88.28,"duration":2.48,"text":"performance and production performance"},{"start":89.72,"duration":3.0,"text":"grows."},{"start":90.76,"duration":3.44,"text":"The result is what many teams experience"},{"start":92.72,"duration":4.24,"text":"today."},{"start":94.2,"duration":6.44,"text":"High benchmark scores, as you can see,"},{"start":96.96,"duration":3.68,"text":"but unreliable production behavior."},{"start":101.56,"duration":3.24,"text":"Traditional LLM evaluation focus on"},{"start":103.24,"duration":3.16,"text":"outputs."},{"start":104.8,"duration":3.36,"text":"But we should ask the question did the"},{"start":106.4,"duration":3.8,"text":"model produce the correct answer?"},{"start":108.16,"duration":3.72,"text":"Agentic systems force us to ask a"},{"start":110.2,"duration":4.48,"text":"different question. Did the system"},{"start":111.88,"duration":5.6,"text":"behave correctly? Behavior includes"},{"start":114.68,"duration":4.32,"text":"planning quality, tool usage, execution,"},{"start":117.48,"duration":4.16,"text":"workflow execution, recovery from"},{"start":119.0,"duration":5.04,"text":"failures, decision-making. In other"},{"start":121.64,"duration":4.76,"text":"words, we are moving from evaluating"},{"start":124.04,"duration":4.16,"text":"answers to evaluating workflows. And"},{"start":126.4,"duration":4.4,"text":"that requires fundamentally different"},{"start":128.2,"duration":4.56,"text":"evaluation architectures."},{"start":130.8,"duration":4.36,"text":"Many teams still think hallucinations"},{"start":132.76,"duration":3.8,"text":"are the primary AI failure modes. In"},{"start":135.16,"duration":2.56,"text":"production, they are often just one"},{"start":136.56,"duration":3.4,"text":"category."},{"start":137.72,"duration":4.6,"text":"Agentic systems introduce an entire"},{"start":139.96,"duration":4.48,"text":"hierarchy of failure modes. At the very"},{"start":142.32,"duration":4.36,"text":"foundation, the memory failures,"},{"start":144.44,"duration":3.84,"text":"retrieval failures, safety failures. As"},{"start":146.68,"duration":3.6,"text":"you go up, you have to think about"},{"start":148.28,"duration":4.12,"text":"reasoning mistakes, poor planning,"},{"start":150.28,"duration":3.24,"text":"incorrect tool execution. At the highest"},{"start":152.4,"duration":3.28,"text":"layer, you have to think about"},{"start":153.52,"duration":4.68,"text":"multi-agent coordination failures."},{"start":155.68,"duration":4.84,"text":"And this is why evaluating only model"},{"start":158.2,"duration":4.8,"text":"output misses the most production risk"},{"start":160.52,"duration":4.28,"text":"we observe."},{"start":163.0,"duration":4.64,"text":"One of the most useful mindset shifts is"},{"start":164.8,"duration":4.72,"text":"to stop thinking like researchers and"},{"start":167.64,"duration":3.28,"text":"start thinking like a SRE or a"},{"start":169.52,"duration":3.44,"text":"production engineer."},{"start":170.92,"duration":3.92,"text":"SREs don't measure success using"},{"start":172.96,"duration":4.08,"text":"accuracy. They measure reliability,"},{"start":174.84,"duration":3.64,"text":"availability latency cost recovery."},{"start":177.04,"duration":2.44,"text":"And agentic systems require the same"},{"start":178.48,"duration":2.88,"text":"approach."},{"start":179.48,"duration":3.84,"text":"The goal is not maximizing the benchmark"},{"start":181.36,"duration":3.8,"text":"scores. The goal is to maximize"},{"start":183.32,"duration":3.08,"text":"dependable outcomes."},{"start":185.16,"duration":2.56,"text":"Reliability becomes the North Star"},{"start":186.4,"duration":5.84,"text":"metric."},{"start":187.72,"duration":4.52,"text":"Accuracy becomes the only input."},{"start":194.76,"duration":3.08,"text":"In this pyramid is how I think"},{"start":196.72,"duration":2.84,"text":"personally think about modern AI"},{"start":197.84,"duration":3.44,"text":"evaluation systems. At the bottom, you"},{"start":199.56,"duration":3.0,"text":"can see they are benchmarks. They are"},{"start":201.28,"duration":2.84,"text":"useful. They are scalable. They are"},{"start":202.56,"duration":2.76,"text":"repeatable. But their operational value"},{"start":204.12,"duration":2.96,"text":"is limited."},{"start":205.32,"duration":4.0,"text":"In the middle, there are scenario-based"},{"start":207.08,"duration":3.44,"text":"evaluations. These simulate realistic"},{"start":209.32,"duration":2.88,"text":"workflows."},{"start":210.52,"duration":3.6,"text":"And at the very top, you see production"},{"start":212.2,"duration":4.08,"text":"telemetry. This is where the highest"},{"start":214.12,"duration":3.88,"text":"value evaluation signals come from. The"},{"start":216.28,"duration":3.8,"text":"surprising insight is that the most"},{"start":218.0,"duration":6.36,"text":"evaluation data often comes from real"},{"start":220.08,"duration":4.28,"text":"users interacting with real systems."},{"start":225.12,"duration":2.92,"text":"Now, let's talk about AI offline"},{"start":226.16,"duration":3.44,"text":"evaluations. So, offline evaluation"},{"start":228.04,"duration":3.8,"text":"still matters, but the methodology"},{"start":229.6,"duration":4.36,"text":"changes. Instead of evaluating prompts,"},{"start":231.84,"duration":3.84,"text":"we evaluate scenarios. For example,"},{"start":233.96,"duration":2.72,"text":"a customer support workflow, a code"},{"start":235.68,"duration":2.88,"text":"generation workflow, a research"},{"start":236.68,"duration":3.72,"text":"workflow. The agent operates inside that"},{"start":238.56,"duration":4.16,"text":"simulated environment. We measure the"},{"start":240.4,"duration":4.24,"text":"task completion rate, tool correctness,"},{"start":242.72,"duration":3.28,"text":"planning quality, resource usage, which"},{"start":244.64,"duration":4.28,"text":"is which becomes"},{"start":246.0,"duration":4.64,"text":"exponentially high at high scale."},{"start":248.92,"duration":3.04,"text":"The key takeaway, agent evaluation"},{"start":250.64,"duration":3.72,"text":"should be scenario driven, not prompt"},{"start":251.96,"duration":2.4,"text":"driven."},{"start":254.4,"duration":4.08,"text":"Once a system reaches production, every"},{"start":256.52,"duration":3.6,"text":"interaction becomes a signal."},{"start":258.48,"duration":3.68,"text":"This is one of the biggest shifts in"},{"start":260.12,"duration":4.16,"text":"evaluation thinking. Production traffic"},{"start":262.16,"duration":3.68,"text":"is no longer just traffic. It becomes"},{"start":264.28,"duration":3.52,"text":"evaluation data."},{"start":265.84,"duration":4.04,"text":"We collect execution traces,"},{"start":267.8,"duration":4.32,"text":"user outcomes, escalations, failures,"},{"start":269.88,"duration":3.8,"text":"feedback signals. Production is the"},{"start":272.12,"duration":3.88,"text":"largest and the most representative"},{"start":273.68,"duration":4.92,"text":"evaluation data any organization will"},{"start":276.0,"duration":2.6,"text":"ever have."},{"start":279.2,"duration":4.56,"text":"Many organizations view humans as"},{"start":280.96,"duration":5.4,"text":"fallback systems. I think that's a wrong"},{"start":283.76,"duration":4.36,"text":"framing. Humans are the evaluators. They"},{"start":286.36,"duration":4.32,"text":"provide signals that automated systems"},{"start":288.12,"duration":4.88,"text":"cannot. They assess correctness, trust,"},{"start":290.68,"duration":3.84,"text":"usefulness, safety. These signals become"},{"start":293.0,"duration":3.56,"text":"really critical for calibrating"},{"start":294.52,"duration":4.68,"text":"evaluation pipelines and identifying"},{"start":296.56,"duration":4.44,"text":"blind spots in automated metrics."},{"start":299.2,"duration":3.88,"text":"The most successful systems combine"},{"start":301.0,"duration":4.48,"text":"automated evaluation with targeted human"},{"start":303.08,"duration":2.4,"text":"review."},{"start":306.28,"duration":5.52,"text":"Now, agent systems drift constantly."},{"start":308.68,"duration":5.04,"text":"Model changes. You have a new version"},{"start":311.8,"duration":4.52,"text":"every couple of weeks or months. Prompts"},{"start":313.72,"duration":3.96,"text":"can change, tools can change, user"},{"start":316.32,"duration":3.12,"text":"behavior can change. The challenge is"},{"start":317.68,"duration":3.76,"text":"that no longer single change appear"},{"start":319.44,"duration":4.24,"text":"catastrophic. Reliability slowly"},{"start":321.44,"duration":4.08,"text":"degrades. Success rate declines,"},{"start":323.68,"duration":4.28,"text":"escalation increases, tool failure"},{"start":325.52,"duration":4.28,"text":"rises. Without continuous evaluation,"},{"start":327.96,"duration":3.2,"text":"teams often don't discover drift until"},{"start":329.8,"duration":5.4,"text":"users complain."},{"start":331.16,"duration":4.04,"text":"Continuous monitoring becomes essential."},{"start":336.16,"duration":4.44,"text":"Observability and evaluation are"},{"start":338.0,"duration":4.32,"text":"inseparable inseparable. To evaluate an"},{"start":340.6,"duration":3.6,"text":"agent, we need visibility into the"},{"start":342.32,"duration":3.84,"text":"reasoning paths, the tool calls, the"},{"start":344.2,"duration":4.0,"text":"memory access, execution timelines, the"},{"start":346.16,"duration":3.24,"text":"state transitions, as you can see here"},{"start":348.2,"duration":2.92,"text":"in this chart,"},{"start":349.4,"duration":6.44,"text":"traditional logs are not sufficient. We"},{"start":351.12,"duration":6.48,"text":"need detailed traces, just like with any"},{"start":355.84,"duration":3.76,"text":"deep nested microservice architecture"},{"start":357.6,"duration":3.36,"text":"for any application or service you're"},{"start":359.6,"duration":2.72,"text":"talking about."},{"start":360.96,"duration":2.6,"text":"Agent traces become the equivalent of"},{"start":362.32,"duration":2.76,"text":"distributed tracing for autonomous"},{"start":363.56,"duration":5.28,"text":"workloads. Without observability,"},{"start":365.08,"duration":3.76,"text":"evaluation becomes the guesswork."},{"start":370.76,"duration":3.04,"text":"Let's talk about the continuous"},{"start":371.96,"duration":3.4,"text":"evaluation loop because evaluation is an"},{"start":373.8,"duration":3.48,"text":"always-running service, not a testing"},{"start":375.36,"duration":3.6,"text":"phase."},{"start":377.28,"duration":3.4,"text":"Historically, evaluation always happened"},{"start":378.96,"duration":3.24,"text":"before deployment, but now evaluation"},{"start":380.68,"duration":4.72,"text":"continues after deployment till you may"},{"start":382.2,"duration":5.52,"text":"identify issues, as you can see in A."},{"start":385.4,"duration":3.96,"text":"Human reviews the edge cases, feedback"},{"start":387.72,"duration":3.72,"text":"improves the data sets, offline"},{"start":389.36,"duration":3.28,"text":"scenarios validate updates, the loop"},{"start":391.44,"duration":3.92,"text":"never stops."},{"start":392.64,"duration":5.84,"text":"Evaluation is no longer just a phase,"},{"start":395.36,"duration":4.8,"text":"it's an operational capability."},{"start":398.48,"duration":4.32,"text":"This is probably the most important"},{"start":400.16,"duration":4.4,"text":"slide in this presentation. Every metric"},{"start":402.8,"duration":2.96,"text":"shown here maps directly to a business"},{"start":404.56,"duration":2.48,"text":"outcome."},{"start":405.76,"duration":2.96,"text":"Task completion measures value"},{"start":407.04,"duration":3.36,"text":"delivered. Tool success measures"},{"start":408.72,"duration":3.88,"text":"operational reliability."},{"start":410.4,"duration":4.76,"text":"Escalation rate measures human burden."},{"start":412.6,"duration":4.88,"text":"Safety violations measure risk exposure."},{"start":415.16,"duration":5.32,"text":"Latency affects user experience. Cost"},{"start":417.48,"duration":4.68,"text":"determines scalability. Recovery rate"},{"start":420.48,"duration":3.52,"text":"reflects resilience."},{"start":422.16,"duration":3.12,"text":"And notice but notice that accuracy is"},{"start":424.0,"duration":2.52,"text":"missing."},{"start":425.28,"duration":3.24,"text":"It's not because accuracy doesn't"},{"start":426.52,"duration":6.0,"text":"matter, but because business success"},{"start":428.52,"duration":4.0,"text":"depends on much more than just accuracy."},{"start":432.6,"duration":3.8,"text":"Now, this is the architecture where the"},{"start":434.56,"duration":3.2,"text":"industry is heading more or less."},{"start":436.4,"duration":3.32,"text":"Evaluation becomes part of the control"},{"start":437.76,"duration":3.92,"text":"plane, not a separate tool, not an"},{"start":439.72,"duration":3.52,"text":"offline process. The control plane"},{"start":441.68,"duration":3.8,"text":"continuously, which observes the"},{"start":443.24,"duration":4.96,"text":"systems, collects telemetry, runs"},{"start":445.48,"duration":4.72,"text":"simulations, coordinates human review,"},{"start":448.2,"duration":3.84,"text":"and the execution plane performs the"},{"start":450.2,"duration":3.48,"text":"work. The control plane measures and"},{"start":452.04,"duration":3.2,"text":"governs the behavior, and this"},{"start":453.68,"duration":5.16,"text":"separation is becoming a foundational"},{"start":455.24,"duration":3.6,"text":"pattern for production AI systems."},{"start":459.24,"duration":4.64,"text":"Now, let's summarize the key lessons."},{"start":460.84,"duration":4.96,"text":"First, benchmarks remains necessary, but"},{"start":463.88,"duration":4.32,"text":"they are insufficient."},{"start":465.8,"duration":4.72,"text":"Second, agent systems must be valued as"},{"start":468.2,"duration":4.52,"text":"workflows, not individual outputs."},{"start":470.52,"duration":4.72,"text":"Third, production telemetry is a most"},{"start":472.72,"duration":4.48,"text":"important evaluation signal."},{"start":475.24,"duration":3.92,"text":"Fourth, reliability ultimately matters"},{"start":477.2,"duration":4.92,"text":"more than raw model accuracy. And"},{"start":479.16,"duration":5.36,"text":"finally, evaluation is becoming"},{"start":482.12,"duration":4.04,"text":"the infrastructure, not testing, not QA"},{"start":484.52,"duration":3.24,"text":"infrastructure."},{"start":486.16,"duration":3.44,"text":"This is the shift every organization"},{"start":487.76,"duration":4.36,"text":"building agent AI will eventually need"},{"start":489.6,"duration":2.52,"text":"to make."}]}